# probe5 -- two-window arrangement for the DESK19 Default-dir pair: Alt+C
# opens C:\, double-click DESKT19 opens C:\DESKT19\ staggered, then a
# title-bar drag moves it down so both windows are visible. do_wredraw
# dumps the moved window's item coordinates.
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 key 38
1550 key 2e
1600 key ae
1650 key b8
2800 mark B_CWIN
3100 move 515 103
3400 down
3403 up
3410 down
3413 up
4100 parkbr
5000 mark C_SUBWIN
5300 move 300 77
5900 down
6700 drag 300 200
7500 drag 300 308
8300 up
8900 parkbr
9800 mark D_MOVED
